Package: com.m3ga.nobadges
Name: M3gaNoBadges
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Hide red notification badges on Home Screen app icons with one simple switch. Badge data and notifications are not deleted; turning the tweak off restores the badges.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
